    "detailed_description": "Girl Survivor is a survival, construction, and role-playing game with a zombie themed background.<br />\r\nbackground<br />\r\nThe story takes place in the future, where the world is occupied by zombies, and countless people are infected by zombies and become zombies<br />\r\nAnd you may be the last human girl in the world<br />\r\nLiving in an abandoned building<br />\r\nBut you haven't given up hope. You are still in this world, and there are still many survivors like you fighting hard to survive<br />\r\nplaying method<br />\r\nWhen you are alone in a zombie world<br />\r\nYour only task is to survive<br />\r\nCollect materials<br />\r\nAlthough zombies are cruel, they lack wisdom.<br />\r\nYou must be in a building full of zombies, and you must learn to deal with them in order to find opportunities to collect materials for daily life<br />\r\nbuild<br />\r\nUse all available resources to build your own shelter to resist zombie attacks<br />\r\nplant<br />\r\nThe ready-made food is becoming increasingly scarce, and you must plant your own plants<br />\r\nWhen you collect plant seeds, you can plant them and harvest more!<br />\r\nSurvivors<br />\r\nKind and forever you, always believe that there are more people in this world waiting for you to save",
